# nexora-action-code: get_stp
Value Required INSTANCE (\d+)
Value Required INTERFACE ([A-Za-z][\w-]*\s*\d[\d/.:]*)
Value Required ROLE (\S+)
Value Required STATE (\S+)
Value Required PROTECTION (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*(?:MST|VLAN)\s+ID\s+Port\s+Role\s+STP\s+State\s+Protection\s*$$ -> Rows

Rows
  ^\s*${INSTANCE}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${ROLE}\s+${STATE}\s+${PROTECTION}\s*$$ -> Record
